# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  Naval Architecture Engineering Suite v2
#  PUBLIC REPOSITORY — SHOWCASE ONLY
#
#  The application source is not published. This repository carries
#  the README, the screenshots and the studio logo assets — nothing
#  else. The rules below ignore everything by default, then allow
#  back only those three things, so an accidental `git add -A`
#  cannot publish code.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Ignore everything.
*

# ── Allowed back: the showcase itself ────────────────────────────
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE

!screenshots/
!screenshots/*.png
!screenshots/*.jpg

!assets/
!assets/*.png
!assets/*.svg

# ── Never publish, belt and braces ──────────────────────────────
#
# These come LAST on purpose. In .gitignore the last matching rule wins,
# so naming them here means no `!` rule added above can ever let them
# through. Scripts, workbooks and data stay local.

*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/

*.xlsx
*.xlsm
*.xls
*.csv

bin/
obj/
.vs/
publish/
output/
outputs/
*.user
*.suo
.DS_Store
